  m_elements:
  - guidHash: 540778221
    text: Everyone has gold in their pockets, just gotta beat it out of em.
  - guidHash: -782171836
    text: You found a oddly large toe, seems lucky?
  - guidHash: 622652962
    text: What could go better with a nice refreshing potion?
  - guidHash: 24740854
    text: A lovely warm bath, in what appears to be...cream?
  - guidHash: 1251865343
    text: Nothing is quite as holy as the simple chest.
  - guidHash: 1233549183
    text: Destroy relics for blessings.
  - guidHash: -39074577
    text: At their core, relics are just blessings with extra steps.
  - guidHash: -1770773694
    text: 'The jacket itself is fine, but for some reason, a bunch of the peasents
      here got super weird about me wearing it. '
  - guidHash: -1680524717
    text: 'Curiosity and exploration can rejuvenate the soul. '
  - guidHash: -2000754098
    text: Peasants are issued one pair of boots a year. The boots never last an entire
      year.
  - guidHash: -1840453806
    text: Tasty rainbow
  - guidHash: -650230487
    text: An old explorer once said that gold can be found in hidden places.
  - guidHash: -2139671564
    text: 'The most magic wand in the known world, but also the most fragile. '
  - guidHash: 1918558942
    text: The Emperor shines his light down on you.
  - guidHash: -1655286976
    text: Pilfers are known for stealing gold, but storing it for you, well thats
      new.
  - guidHash: 1670328365
    text: Why would you keep these sharp blades in your pockets? Seems unwise.
  - guidHash: 1874654790
    text: Gilded Gauntlets
  - guidHash: -1421196385
    text: Worn by Sanctum sculptors to appear regal and powerful, trying to mask
      the philistine lies.
  - guidHash: -615636160
    text: Due fly related accident during its forging, the handle of this massive
      tool is quite a bit shorter than it should be.
  - guidHash: 2111729323
    text: A novelty keychain found on the keys to Black Rabbit's cell.
  - guidHash: 1567832749
    text: Due to a fly related accident during it's forging, the handle of this massive
      tool is quite a bit shorter than it should be.
  - guidHash: -1005969797
    text: 'In the darkness there is light. '
  - guidHash: -1304172307
    text: Sometimes the mines unearth ancient secrets not meant for any being to
      lay their eyes upon. This is one such horror.
  - guidHash: 43963526
    text: 'An ingenious inventor came to the faith late, and made the most of his
      second life. '
  - guidHash: 1860610704
    text: Beltrame creates some wonderful potions, but I do wonder where all the
      waste goes?
  - guidHash: 1732413302
    text: 'A totem depicting an ancient god of life and the natural order. '
  - guidHash: 584029238
    text: 'Normally a healthy lifestyle makes for a healthy body, but peasants make
      due with what they got. '
  - guidHash: -180616374
    text: Hoarding gold has always been a tatic of the wealthy and elite, no wonder
      they seem so powerful.
  - guidHash: -67876275
    text: Every little helps.
  - guidHash: -37702875
    text: The shop holds many secrets, and you've just been let in on one.
  - guidHash: -1536217873
    text: A key that looks like it could open any door.
  - guidHash: -1124808619
    text: Nothing quite says fool like some fool's gold.
  - guidHash: 303701289
    text: 'This Elderseed seems to have mutated, it oozes something that doesn''t
      look very nice. '
  - guidHash: -717052596
    text: These pilfers will shake down anyone who crosses their path if it means
      a little extra gold.
  - guidHash: 232501871
    text: The plague is a familar blight of the peasant and with that comes the rats.
  - guidHash: -1923232017
    text: Nothing quite like helping out a local business.
  - guidHash: 700904090
    text: The best things in life are those that are free!
  - guidHash: -1922036168
    text: A kernel of corn, blessed by a mighty priest who thought it may bring good
      luck to the future harvest.
  - guidHash: 606738836
    text: Plant Leaf
  - guidHash: -754791869
    text: These little leaves look like they are quite edible.
  - guidHash: 276503105
    text: These gold pieces would have prefered to stay lodged with the rocks.
  - guidHash: -439612761
    text: A token of friendship between the pilfers and peasants of Delvemore.
  - guidHash: -1305441280
    text: RIP AND TEAR UNTIL IT IS DONE.
  - guidHash: -1372392542
    text: I wonder who these skulls used to belong to?
  - guidHash: 735039217
    text: 'This thief''s tool bears the engraving of a rabbit. Also, an engraving
      that reads "Black Rabbit''s, hands off!" Further down it also reads "Seriously!" '
  - guidHash: -526797796
    text: Always eat your veggies!
  - guidHash: -923546745
    text: Transmute Statue Cost Increase
  - guidHash: 1983987256
    text: Its too cheap in the base game.
  - guidHash: -754573880
    text: Too much gold in the base game.
  - guidHash: 1192452755
    text: Enemies are too weak in the base game.
  - guidHash: 470154009
    text: Dont take enough damage in the base game.
  - guidHash: -1503613438
    text: HP too high in base game.
  - guidHash: 452927784
    text: 'Strength and Dexterity are too high in the base game. '
  - guidHash: 2135772902
    text: Deals with the devil are never quite worth the price you pay.
  - guidHash: -1065593332
    text: A tasty little leaf.
  - guidHash: -2060143959
    text: Gloves worn by the old guard to ward off evil spirits.
  - guidHash: 1160186849
    text: This candle protects from danger but something about it seems unnatural.
  - guidHash: 1466046654
    text: Wealth, but at what cost?
  - guidHash: 1137579462
    text: Seems like Sho'guul and the shopkeeper made a deal.
  - guidHash: 258623003
    text: Coffee, straight into the veins, all the time.
  - guidHash: -1422381718
    text: Shroud your body in metal so that you may feel no pain.
  - guidHash: -1453147761
    text: No pain no gain.
  - guidHash: 967036207
    text: This gift comes at a cost.
  - guidHash: -2043486611
    text: Food just doesnt taste the same without your special seasoning.
  - guidHash: -48610449
    text: These boots seem strange.
  - guidHash: 208914220
    text: Baggledag has a bounty on his head, will you be the one to claim it?
  - guidHash: 888883818
    text: To desecrate an altar of worship is to laugh in the face of the greater
      powers.
  - guidHash: -527607219
    text: These shockwaves really do pack quite the punch.
  - guidHash: 1495782128
    text: The metal this pickaxe is made from seems strange?
  - guidHash: 289416233
    text: The master's wear these hats to hone their magical powers.
  - guidHash: 1147454776
    text: A force to be reckoned with.
  - guidHash: -1195403896
    text: All donations are welcome. But who is collecting them?
  - guidHash: -391569514
    text: Chrysopoeia
  - guidHash: -1707543074
    text: Gold Nuggets haben eine Chance verbessert zu werden, wenn sie landen.
  - guidHash: 1424617820
    text: Chrysopoeia is the art of creating gold from nothing, an endless cycle
      to be repeated.
  - guidHash: 1610991395
    text: Experten Entdecker
  - guidHash: -1916633534
    text: "Geheimr\xE4ume haben eine Chance mehr als \xFCblich zu enthalten."
  - guidHash: -1102772234
    text: These worn papers can still be of some use.
  - guidHash: 682646194
    text: Perfekte Mischung
  - guidHash: 91360686
    text: "Einen Trank zu trinken aktiviert einen zuf\xE4lligen zeitlichen Trankeffekt."
  - guidHash: -726174470
    text: This concoction can be quite deadly if you don't know what you're doing.
  - guidHash: 1380617407
    text: Einblick
  - guidHash: 983936473
    text: Verringert die Arcana-Kosten.
  - guidHash: 970320576
    text: Through insight we gain enlightenment.
  - guidHash: 1431548255
    text: "Besch\xE4digte Alt\xE4re"
  - guidHash: 836901224
    text: "Erhalte einen zus\xE4tzlichen Fluch von Alt\xE4ren, der jedoch immer entfernt
      wird, wenn du Bu\xDFe tust."
  - guidHash: -1225464520
    text: These Altars seem to spew dark light from every crack.
  - guidHash: -1596639059
    text: "G\xF6ttliche Ber\xFChrung"
  - guidHash: 1159566258
    text: Eine Chance Gegner beim schlagen zu heilen.
  - guidHash: 127420662
    text: Healing hand are not always the blessing they appear to be.
  - guidHash: 424238075
    text: "Goldene Ber\xFChrung"
  - guidHash: -1644304591
    text: "F\xFCgt eine Chance hinzu, dass Gegner bei einem Treffer Gold Nuggets
      fallen lassen."
  - guidHash: -846465979
    text: Mini-Spitzhacke
  - guidHash: -1968013997
    text: "Erh\xF6ht dein Eifer erheblich, verringert jedoch auch die Reichweite
      stark."
  - guidHash: -1026828664
    text: "Gef\xFClltes Sandwich"
  - guidHash: 1281558143
    text: "Alle Tr\xE4nke heilen dich bei Verwendung gerinf\xFCgig."
  - guidHash: -1108866584
    text: "Pl\xFCnderer Bank"
  - guidHash: 1930611847
    text: "Du erh\xE4ltst F\xE4higkeiten, aber das Relikt zerbricht, wenn du Gold
      ausgibst."
  - guidHash: -377645632
    text: "F\xFCge eine Chance hinzu, bei einem Treffer Gilde auf Gegner anzuwenden."
  - guidHash: 1598319772
    text: Guantes' Regenmantel
  - guidHash: -845948562
    text: Verhindert elementare Statuseffekte.
  - guidHash: -1792935340
    text: Cremebad
  - guidHash: -1016801395
    text: Erhalte kurzeitig physische Schadensresistenz nachdem du getroffen wurdest.
  - guidHash: -1769657135
    text: Gesegnete Truhe
  - guidHash: 479530548
    text: "Gew\xE4hrt jeder Truhe eine Chance von 25%, einen zuf\xE4lligen Segen
      zu entdecken."
  - guidHash: -1602624992
    text: Obsidian Stab
  - guidHash: 1609995291
    text: Steigert dein Mana dramatisch, zerbricht jedoch wenn es getroffen wird.
  - guidHash: 1088214855
    text: Mega-Spitzhacke
  - guidHash: -1459315563
    text: "Erh\xF6ht deine Reichweite und St\xE4rke erheblich, setzt jedoch dein
      Eifer auf 1 f\xFCr den Rest des Durchlaufs."
  - guidHash: -1671121772
    text: Playdough Spitzhacke
  - guidHash: 1089042749
    text: Jeder Schlag hat die Chance einen anderen elementaren Schadenseffekt zu
      verursachen.
  - guidHash: 1127976449
    text: Recycler V2
  - guidHash: 2024650576
    text: "Zerst\xF6re Relikte f\xFCr Segen. Funktioniert nur an Relikten, welche
      in Reliktr\xE4umen gefunden werden!"
  - guidHash: 10095820
    text: Riesen Zeh
  - guidHash: -1178399722
    text: "Gegner zu t\xF6ten gibt eine geringe Chance dein Gl\xFCck zu erh\xF6hen!"
  - guidHash: -1237065613
    text: Scharfe Taschen
  - guidHash: -82024814
    text: "Gold auszugeben f\xFCgt dir Schaden zu."
  - guidHash: -1938340126
    text: "Zartf\xFC\xDFig"
  - guidHash: -2074747749
    text: Springen tut dir weh.
  - guidHash: -622005679
    text: Regeneration
  - guidHash: -1731503541
    text: Heile beim pfadfinden.
  - guidHash: -142455601
    text: Abenteuerisch
  - guidHash: -1649103270
    text: "Geheimnisse halten Reicht\xFCmer."
  - guidHash: 1448832851
    text: Macht des Kaisers
  - guidHash: -1819620339
    text: "Erh\xF6ht deine St\xE4rke, Ausdauer und Intelligenz um einen kleinen Prozentsatz."
  - guidHash: 280339030
    text: Totem des Lebens
  - guidHash: 1664160250
    text: Heile beim pfadfinden 6 HP.
  - guidHash: -1540076425
    text: Aphotischer Zauber
  - guidHash: -962372198
    text: "Heile beim pfadfinden f\xFCr jeden Fluch den du hast."
  - guidHash: 2047859672
    text: Donnerschlag
  - guidHash: -19843859
    text: "Werde manchmal vom Blitz getroffen, was dir f\xFCr eine kurze Zeit einen
      zuf\xE4lligen Trankteffekt verleiht."
  - guidHash: 1635371893
    text: Gesegnetes Popcorn
  - guidHash: -101673242
    text: Segen haben eine Chance sich zu verdoppelt wenn sie zu Boden fallen.
  - guidHash: 1145902201
    text: Umkehrer
  - guidHash: -27869745
    text: "Verlorene Fl\xFCche werden zu Segen."
  - guidHash: 1685269973
    text: Flaschen-Schwefel
  - guidHash: -1842885268
    text: "Feuere einen Schwefelstrahl beim schwingen ab. Zerst\xF6re Felsen und
      f\xFCge Feinden Schaden zu wenn du zielst. Halbiert deine maximalen HP beim
      Aufnehmen."
  - guidHash: -1317969372
    text: Herzlichkeit
  - guidHash: -1467839534
    text: "Erh\xF6he die Effektivit\xE4t von Heilung."
  - guidHash: -1126349855
    text: "Erm\xE4chtigendes Gold"
  - guidHash: -573854356
    text: "St\xE4rke erh\xF6ht sich um die Menge an Gold, die du tr\xE4gst."
  - guidHash: -1379132982
    text: Bescheidene Hilfe
  - guidHash: 1865393030
    text: "F\xFCgt eine Chance hinzu, dass Schl\xFCssel und Bomben verbessert werden."
  - guidHash: -918760315
    text: "Skelettschl\xFCssel"
  - guidHash: 785984054
    text: "Sch\xE4del k\xF6nnen als Schl\xFCssel verwendet werden."
  - guidHash: 330009733
    text: "Pl\xFCnderer Club Karte"
  - guidHash: 1978834012
    text: "Der Pl\xFCndererladen hat immer einen kostenlosen \"Laden in einer Flasche\"-Trank."
  - guidHash: 111030044
    text: Aggresive Gutscheinpolitik
  - guidHash: -929206894
    text: "Erh\xF6he bei jedem Ladenkauf dein Charisma um 1-3."
  - guidHash: 894832681
    text: Kostenloses Geschenk
  - guidHash: -1782761348
    text: Erhalte einen kostenlosen Trank in jedem Laden.
  - guidHash: 275310752
    text: Narrengold
  - guidHash: 1257618839
    text: Manchmal zerbricht Gold beim aufprallen.
  - guidHash: -95907248
    text: Mutiertes Mana
  - guidHash: -1086066309
    text: Verliere etwas Mana beim pfadfinden.
  - guidHash: -1782119105
    text: "Gepl\xFCnderte Taschen"
  - guidHash: 1239495119
    text: "In Pl\xFCnderer zu laufen kostet dich etwas Gold."
  - guidHash: -1254073212
    text: Findige Ratten
  - guidHash: -24385517
    text: "Pl\xFCnderer werden durch Ratten ersetzt."
  - guidHash: 814718738
    text: "Leckeres Gem\xFCse"
  - guidHash: 1774883278
    text: "Pflanzen schuppen ab und zu essbare Bl\xE4tter ab, die dich heilen."
  - guidHash: -222001710
    text: "Fallenentsch\xE4rfungsset"
  - guidHash: 293970505
    text: "Zerst\xF6re alle Fallen beim betreten eines Raums."
  - guidHash: -1584570444
    text: "Sch\xE4delspalter"
  - guidHash: -1827855000
    text: "Einen Sch\xE4del aufzuheben erh\xF6ht deine max HP um 5."
  - guidHash: 1305870854
    text: "Erfahrener Schl\xE4chter"
  - guidHash: 792968762
    text: "Gegner zu t\xF6ten erh\xF6ht deine prim\xE4ren F\xE4higkeiten."
  - guidHash: -1675605753
    text: "Gold wird von dir angezogen. Du erh\xE4ltst einen 20% Rabatt im Laden."
  - guidHash: 93597975
    text: "Pl\xFCnderer Ring"
  - guidHash: -1283686459
    text: Gold wird versuchen vor dir wegzulaufen.
  - guidHash: -2016421984
    text: Gesalbte Handschuhe
  - guidHash: -241110271
    text: "Erhalte f\xFCr jeden einzigartigen Segen den du hast Ausdauer."
  - guidHash: 779550364
    text: Verfluchte Segen
  - guidHash: 590336404
    text: "L\xE4sst eine Kopie deines niedrigststufigen Segens fallen, wenn du einen
      Fluch erh\xE4ltst."
  - guidHash: -85737731
    text: Verfluchter Reichtum
  - guidHash: 430377920
    text: "Erhalte 8000 Gold, aber erhalte einen zuf\xE4lligen klebrigen Fluch."
  - guidHash: -1643393907
    text: Rabatt des Teufels
  - guidHash: -831717502
    text: Erhalte 70% Rabatt im Laden, aber erhalte einen Fluch mit jedem 3rd. Einkauf.
  - guidHash: -1263866586
    text: Filterkaffee
  - guidHash: -396181352
    text: "Erh\xF6ht dein Tempo und Eifer."
  - guidHash: -450620636
    text: Schmerzt so Gut
  - guidHash: -564606197
    text: "Werde immun gegen den n\xE4chsten Schaden, nachdem du Bu\xDFe getan hast."
  - guidHash: -2145972307
    text: Silberne Saftpresse
  - guidHash: -1142767431
    text: "Ahnensamen erh\xF6hen die max HP um 3."
  - guidHash: -252458135
    text: Elderseeds are full of juice but it's not so easy to get.
  - guidHash: 1976540978
    text: "Spezielle W\xFCrzmischung"
  - guidHash: -460986270
    text: "Nahrung zu schlagen hat eine Chance diese neu zu w\xFCrfeln."
  - guidHash: -950523629
    text: Full Metal Jacket
  - guidHash: -952900758
    text: "F\xFCgt 5 R\xFCstungspunkte hinzu. Setzt max HP auf 1. Ersetzt Nahrung
      durch R\xFCstungsscherben. Gew\xE4hrt Immunit\xE4t gegen Schaden-\xFCber-Zeit-Effekten."
  - guidHash: 1145511058
    text: Sho'Guuls Geschenk
  - guidHash: -525751354
    text: "Ersetzt 2 zuf\xE4llige Relikte durch 4 neue."
  - guidHash: -1536546593
    text: Entweihung
  - guidHash: 974433610
    text: "Altare zu sprengen gibt dir einen zus\xE4tzlichen Segen."
  - guidHash: 1769575082
    text: Magnetische Spitzhacke
  - guidHash: 1831498259
    text: "Spitzhacken-Schl\xE4ge ziehen Gegner n\xE4her zu dir heran."
  - guidHash: -1509218046
    text: Meisterhut
  - guidHash: -1901203545
    text: "Erh\xF6ht deine Intelliugenz um 15% f\xFCr jedes Relikt das du besitzt,
      das mit Intelligenz skaliert."
  - guidHash: -709861488
    text: Schlagwellen
  - guidHash: -148559360
    text: "Schockwellen sto\xDFen Gegner zur\xFCck und verursachen ihnen bei der
      Landung Schaden."
  - guidHash: -1630707366
    text: Zehnt
  - guidHash: -44344328
    text: "\xC4ndert die Kosten von Bu\xDFe von Leben zu Gold."
  - guidHash: -1989064432
    text: 'Boss-Kopfgeld '
  - guidHash: 433799246
    text: "Erhalte ein Relikt f\xFCr jeden Boss den du besiegst."
  - guidHash: 1593266280
    text: Waghalsigkeit
  - guidHash: -1950366414
    text: "F\xFCge Gegnern zus\xE4tzlichen Schaden zu, der von deinem Leichtsinn
      abh\xE4ngt."
  - guidHash: 104519486
    text: Magnetisierte Schuhe
  - guidHash: -1684241261
    text: "Wenn du nach einem Sprung landest, st\xF6\xDFt du Gold weg und ziehst
      Gegner zu dir heran."
